I'll make this video quick not just  because that's what I usually aim to  achieve with my videos but because based  on my previous content of this nature  it'll likely be nerfed pretty soon after  this won't show you how to get 100  classifieds an hour or anything but it  still feels like the quickest and most  reliable way at this stage especially if  you're running solo using this method  will give you up to three classified  pieces in 30 minutes possibly more if  you're better accelerating resistance to  me which to be fair wouldn't be that  hard first you need to equip your best  solo built here I'm using my six piece  d3 if NC sit I'll leave a link to the  build in the description after that head  over and start up one of the resistance  missions make your way through the early  waves and head towards the first  resistance reward chest  it'll be behind a door that costs 7,500  s HD tech to unlock farm the NPC's to  gain as many credits as possible  remember to delay killing the bosses in  wave 5 and 10 as long as you can so that  more NPCs are spawned in allowing you to  gain more credits the resistance reward  chest has a very high chance of dropping  classified pieces most of the time would  click 2 to 3 classifieds per run each  run taking about 30 minutes you'll also  have an additional chance that another  classified through the tier 2 resistance  cache that you gain from completing the  wave 10 bosses the first reward will  cost you 1500 is HD tech with each  consecutive reward costing you 1500 more  than the last by the time you reach wave  15 with the 3 hunter bosses you should  have unlocked 3 rewards from the chest  if you can go further good luck but  usually at this point I would restart  and repeat this could be running teams  too but the required tech to open the  reward chest steps up considerably so  depending on the team it probably isn't  worth while for example a team of 2  would have the first reward costing 3000  instead of 1,500 and a team of 3 or more  would cost 6000 running in a team of 2  isn't too bad as long as one of you is  pretty well geared you'll only be able  to open to reward chips before wave 15  but the advantages that you'll be able  to share what you receive in my opinion  this is the fastest way for a solo  player to gain classified pieces I've  had a fair amount of luck in the dark  zone but there's a huge amount of rng  involved there and on a lucky day you  still wouldn't be getting up to 3 pieces  in half an hour anyway if this has  helped you please let me know below  otherwise I'll catch you next time  Cheers  [Music]
 

